entityDescription:
AIR6 Systems is a leading MANUFACTURER of professional drones with offices in the UK and across Europe. Our high performance systems are sold worldwide and used for manual and automated flights mounted with sensors for:
Agriculture & forestry;
Measuring, mapping, surveying and mining;
Inspection and documentation of buildings, construction sites, critical infrastructure and power assets;
Surveillance and search & rescue (SAR);
Industrial applications & automation; and
Research.
